{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2022-02-09 08:15:00', 'title': 'PALO ALTO NETWORKS CONTINUES ROLLOUT OF FOURTH-GENERATION HARDWARE WITH THE PA-3400 AND PA-5400 SERIES ML-POWERED NEXT-GENERATION FIREWALLS', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., FEB. 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NASDAQ: PANW), RECOGNIZED AS A 10- TIME LEADER IN NETWORK FIREWALLS , TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PA-3400 AND PA-5400 SERIES ML-POWERED NEXT-GENERATION FIREWALLS (NGFWS) — OFFERING THREE TIMES BETTER SECURITY PERFORMANCE OVER THE PREVIOUS GENERATIONS.'}